        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks combine remarkable control of atomic structure with a major advance in precision measurement, enabling stringent tests of fundamental physics as well as practical timekeeping.",
        "attribution": "Katori and Ye made distinct, complementary contributions to the development and realization of optical lattice clocks.",
        "maturity": "The methods have been independently developed and refined over many years, with clear experimental confirmation and continuing use.",
